CreatedAt: 26/08/26
Description: |
  Domain value objects for the chapter aggregate: the entity itself, its partial-update
  counterpart, and the "no chapters" domain exception. Consumed by `ChapterRepository` and by
  chapter-related interactors and services not documented in this forest (e.g. chapter sorting
  and chapter-number recognition), which operate purely on these already-defined types.
